# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# React Router handles routing on the client. Without this rule, a
# direct hit to /products/some-slug or /admin would return 404 because
# no static file exists at that path. The wildcard tells Cloudflare to
# serve index.html for every path that doesn't match a real file,
# preserving the URL so the router can take over.
#
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
/*    /index.html   200
